"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Colette is Elmo’s childhood friend. She has an illness so she’s weak and moves around in a wheelchair. There are two fairies following her around, Jalapeno and Taberuno who are pretty much a two-fairy comedy act. Colette is slightly tsundere and it’s pretty damned obvious she has feelings for Elmo."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"slightly edited from Accany's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c843"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ネミの村に住む、エルモの幼なじみ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"病気がちで身体が弱く、外に出るときは車椅子を利用することが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小さな妖精たち （ハラペーニョ＆タベルノ）がなついている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26807","sourceWorkId":"12610","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"工作：学生 （照顾妖精）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味：写日记"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特技：推测将要发生的事"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"喜欢：制定计划"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"讨厌：计划被打乱"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在ネミ村居住，エルモ的青梅竹马。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为容易得病，所以身体很弱，外出时利用轮椅情况居多。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"与小妖精们 （ハラペーニョ和タベルノ）很是亲近。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「嗯。没有忘记与我的约定，准时来了嘛。这样就足够了」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"26633"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"159 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26807","sourceWorkId":"12610","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8abb21ccd1b5c894c233bc347085b5c492fc852adf16b8759f83f25e171a8a83.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2f/2fb28b974dc552c0a647daf47263259c5e37e4ce327a68a5057d9f9087ba4eae.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小野涼子","creatorId":"vndb:s367","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s367","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s367","name":"小野 涼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:3855:26633:4727:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c846","characterName":"モニカ・ラング","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"26632","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"3855"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26808"],"vndbCharacterId":"c846"},"originalCharacterName":"モニカ・ラング","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"419"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"171"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Monika is a traveling street performer who came to the village. She brings with her a donkey and a pink monkey. Has quite a bit of pride and does what she thinks is right. A little soft-hearted but doesn’t lack in common sense."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Accany's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c846"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"エルモの養父――アルマンドを訪ね、ネミの村までやって来た大道芸人の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"背の高い帽子がトレードマークで、なかなか外そうとしない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ロバのハムと、お猿のチェリーを連れている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26808","sourceWorkId":"12610","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"工作：街头艺人"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味：旅行"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特技：概率计算"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"喜欢：含羞草沙拉"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"讨厌：无聊的日子"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"为了拜访エルモ的养父アルマンド，而来到ネミ村的做着街头艺人的女孩子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特征是戴着很高的帽子，并且怎么也不肯摘下来。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身边带着叫做ハム的驴和叫做チェリー的猴子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「我叫“モニカ”怎么了？モニカ有什么不对吗？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"26632"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"171 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26808","sourceWorkId":"12610","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/52/525967a9682780792e3d156fe92a0d549ad359c2350d330df41e1b7ae4dc86af.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0c7ca1756b9d2c0d30a0ae027d304d6389f32f01a1939a251914771c47282671.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤村歩","creatorId":"vndb:s1703","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1703","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1703","name":"藤村 歩","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:3855:26632:4783:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c847","characterName":"サラ・デュラン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"146480","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"3855"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26809"],"vndbCharacterId":"c847"},"originalCharacterName":"サラ・デュラン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"522"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"157"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The only child in the Dullin household (which happens to be rich). She was the one who found Elmo when he was lying beside the lake. Also a childhood friend. Her relationship with Elmo is pretty tangled up since her mother tries to object Sarah to be in contact with Elmo. But Sarah likes being with Elmo. She’s more of a shy and silent character."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Accany's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c847"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アルバーノの街に住む、領主デュラン家の一人娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼少の頃、湖のほとりに倒れていたエルモを助け、家に連れて帰った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、それ以降は母の教えもあって、表向きエルモとは疎遠気味になる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26809","sourceWorkId":"12610","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"一人称：ワタシ"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事：学生 　趣味：ミニチュア模型作り　 特技：逆上がり （後方支持回転）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好き：アルバーノの街　 嫌い：遠出"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アルバーノの街に住む、領主デュラン家の一人娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼少の頃、湖のほとりに倒れていたエルモを助け、家に連れて帰った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、それ以降は母の教えもあって、表向きエルモとは疎遠気味になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「また月曜日、教会で会えるのを楽しみにしています。――サラ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"146480"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"157 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26809","sourceWorkId":"12610","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a0/a0e0191387ca222085e179203e3e47ce8d94909e726a02f209a4de7ac4a378c4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a89ac81b31afea8a0ab63a1f501a394087210821e8d18ba186621f25dfd040b9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"今井麻美","creatorId":"vndb:s240","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s240","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s240","name":"今井 麻美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:3855:146480:4061:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c83027","characterName":"ガスパーレ・フォルト","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c83027"},"originalCharacterName":"ガスパーレ・フォルト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"803"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"170"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"d